#: ../../solid/kspace_integration.rst:2
msgid "ブリルアンゾーン積分"
msgstr "Brillouin Zone Integration"

#: ../../solid/kspace_integration.rst:4
msgid ""
"ブリルアンゾーン（BZ）積分を有限個のk点の和で近似する方法と、その誤差を学びます。金属では\\ "
":ref:`スメアリング<smearing>`\\ と\\ :ref:`テトラヘドロン法<tetrahedron-method>`\\ "
"でフェルミ面の段差を扱います。最後に、結晶の対称性から\\ :ref:`既約k点<irreducible-kpoint-orbits>`\\ "
"とその重みを求めます。"
msgstr ""
"We examine how to approximate a Brillouin zone (BZ) integral by a sum "
"over a finite set of k-points and how this approximation introduces "
"error. In metals, \\ :ref:`smearing <smearing>`\\  and the \\ "
":ref:`tetrahedron method <tetrahedron-method>`\\  address the "
"discontinuity at the Fermi surface. Finally, we use crystal symmetry to "
"find the \\ :ref:`irreducible k-points <irreducible-kpoint-orbits>`\\  "
"and their weights."

